{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-09-21 14:13:00', 'title': 'JCP&L INSTALLS GUARDS TO PROTECT NEW JERSEY BALD EAGLES', 'text': "COMPREHENSIVE PROTECTION SYSTEM HELPS PREVENT THE ENDANGERED SPECIES FROM RESTING OR NESTING ON ENERGIZED POWER EQUIPMENT MORRISTOWN, N.J. , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO SAFEGUARD NEW JERSEY'S BALD EAGLE POPULATION, JERSEY CENTRAL POWER & LIGHT (JCP&L), A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS INSTALLED PROTECTIVE DEVICES ON ELECTRICAL EQUIPMENT IN AREAS NEAR KNOWN BALD EAGLE NESTS IN HAMBURG TOWNSHIP AND NEAR CULVER LAKE (FRANKFORD), BOTH IN SUSSEX COUNTY."}